  description: "\"Plunder Patroll\" monsters you control gain 500 ATK for each \"Plunder
    Patroll\" card in your Spell & Trap Zone. You can only use each of the following
    effects of \"Plunder Patroll Shipyarrrd\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF You can discard
    1 card; add 1 \"Plunder Patroll\" card from your Deck to your hand, except \"Plunder
    Patroll Shipyarrrd\".\r\n\u25CF If this card is in your GY: You can target 1
    \"Plunder Patroll\" card in your Spell & Trap Zone; Set this card, and if you
    do, return that target to the hand."
